SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 EST: Kennedy Center: Access/VSA Emerging Young Artis
 ts 2027\, Thrive (15 x USD 3\,000)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 19 Nov 2026 at 23:59 EST.\n\nThe Kennedy Center's Access
 /VSA Emerging Young Artists Program (2027 theme: Thrive) awards 15 young d
 isabled visual artists a USD 3\,000 stipend\, an all-expenses-paid career 
 development week in Washington DC (14 to 18 June 2027) and exhibition of o
 ne work.\n\nOrganisation: John F. Kennedy Center for the Performing Arts\,
  Office of Accessibility and VSA\nLocation: USA (50 states\, DC\, Puerto R
 ico and territories\; right to work in the US required). Career week and e
 xhibition in Washington DC.\nAward: 15 winners each receive a USD 3\,000 s
 tipend\, an all-expenses-paid career development week in Washington DC (14
  to 18 June 2027)\, and exhibition of one work in DC. No entry fee.\nDurat
 ion: Three virtual workshops April to June 2027\, DC week 14 to 18 June 20
 27\, then the exhibition.\n\nMore: https://opportunities.wearecreativewest
 .org/opportunity/17971/CAFE?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medi
 um=referral
URL:https://opportunities.wearecreativewest.org/opportunity/17971/CAFE?utm_
 source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:USA (50 states\, DC\, Puerto Rico and territories\; right to work 
 in the US required). Career week and exhibition in Washington DC.
END:VEVENT
