SUMMARY:Deadline: Oregon Media Arts Fellowship 2026 (two USD 5\,000 awards 
 for Oregon media artists)
DESCRIPTION:The Oregon Media Arts Fellowship\, run by the Portland Art Muse
 um's Center for an Untold Tomorrow with the Oregon Arts Commission\, gives
  Oregon media artists money to create or complete new work.\n\nOrganisatio
 n: Portland Art Museum (PAM CUT) and Oregon Arts Commission\nLocation: Ore
 gon\, United States (Oregon residents only).\nAward: Two fellowships of US
 D 5\,000 each\, no matching funds required\; paid within two months of not
 ification. No application fee.\nDuration: One-time award for new work or w
 orks in progress.\n\nMore: https://portlandartmuseum.org/artist-services/o
 regon-media-arts-fellowship/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_med
 ium=referral
