SUMMARY:Deadline: AT&T Untold Stories 2027 (Tribeca Festival): USD 1.2 mill
 ion film production prize
DESCRIPTION:AT&T Untold Stories\, now in its 10th year\, is a production pr
 ize run by the Tribeca Festival and AT&T that funds a feature film from an
  underrepresented filmmaker. Industry judges select five projects\; their 
 filmmakers pitch to a jury of media professionals at the 2027 Tribeca Fest
 ival in June. One project wins USD 1.2 million and the other four finalist
 s receive USD 15\,000 each.\n\nOrganisation: Tribeca Festival and AT&T\nLo
 cation: USA. Applicants must be 18+ and live in the US or Puerto Rico. Fin
 alists pitch in person at the Tribeca Festival\, New York\, June 2027.\nAw
 ard: One winner receives USD 1\,200\,000 to produce the film\; the four ot
 her finalists receive USD 15\,000 grants each. No entry fee.\n\nMore: http
 s://tribecafilm.com/attuntoldstories?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk
 &utm_medium=referral
URL:https://tribecafilm.com/attuntoldstories?utm_source=artificialnouveaugr
 antdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:USA. Applicants must be 18+ and live in the US or Puerto Rico. Fin
 alists pitch in person at the Tribeca Festival\, New York\, June 2027.
END:VEVENT
