TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261202
SUMMARY:Deadline: Tag! Queer Shorts Festival 2027: Call for Submissions (Po
 rtland)
DESCRIPTION:Tag! invites LGBTQIA+ filmmakers to submit finished shorts of 1
 5 minutes or under\, including credits\, in any genre (theme for 2027: "Yo
 u're It!"). About 40 to 45 shorts are selected. English captions are requi
 red\; films made with generative AI are not programmed\; no works in progr
 ess. Submissions open 1 July to 1 December 2026\, exclusively via FilmFree
 way.\n\nOrganisation: Tag! Queer Shorts Festival\nLocation: Portland\, Ore
 gon\, USA (Clinton Street Theater). International.\nAward: Award categorie
 s with cash prizes (amounts not stated): Hispanic/Latine Creativity\, Powe
 r of Community\, Best Erotic Short and Radical Futures Student Film\, plus
  a Festival Director's Award. Modest submission fees on FilmFreeway\; fee 
 waivers for historically excluded communities and filmmakers from countrie
 s that criminalize queer identities\, and discount codes for Pacific North
 west filmmakers.\nDuration: Festival 20 and 21 March 2027\n\nMore: https:/
 /tagqsf.org/call-2027/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=re
 ferral
URL:https://tagqsf.org/call-2027/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm
 _medium=referral
LOCATION:Portland\, Oregon\, USA (Clinton Street Theater). International.
END:VEVENT
